  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "NeurIPS 2024 Oral from NIH/NLM — the only dedicated benchmark for clinical calculator reasoning, a skill systematically absent from existing medical QA benchmarks. Covers 55 real-world scoring systems derived from actual patient notes. CC-BY-SA-4.0 data licence, freely usable. Essential for teams evaluating LLM safety in numerical clinical reasoning tasks where errors carry direct patient-safety implications.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-12",
